cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AI Liver and Hepatic Tumor Segmentation for Surgical Planning"
abstract: >
  SwinUNETR-based automatic 3D segmentation of liver and hepatic tumors on CT,
  combined with Couinaud segment labeling, Future Liver Remnant (FLR) estimation,
  3D Slicer integration via MONAILabel, and MediaPipe-based hand gesture control
  for touchless surgical planning.
authors:
